# SECUTG: generated. Swift 6.4 (Xcode 27) adds the ImplicitStrongCapture and NoUseUnstructuredThrowingTask warnings, and minimum iOS 17 surfaces DeprecatedDeclaration warnings; these targets build with -warnings-as-errors, so keep those groups warnings per module (a global -Wwarning conflicts with -suppress-warnings targets). UnknownWarningGroup comes first so Xcode 26.x (Swift 6.2, which lacks the newer groups) accepts the list.
build:macos --@build_bazel_rules_swift//swift:per_module_swiftcopt=@@//Telegram:BroadcastUploadExtensionLib=-Wwarning,UnknownWarningGroup,-Wwarning,ImplicitStrongCapture,-Wwarning,NoUseUnstructuredThrowingTask,-Wwarning,DeprecatedDeclaration
